description:
Ready() and ReadyAny() methods are nearly identical.

## Issue
Both methods have duplicated JSON parsing logic:
```go
if strings.TrimSpace(out) == "" || strings.TrimSpace(out) == "[]" {
    return nil, nil
}
var beads []Bead
if err := json.Unmarshal([]byte(out), &beads); err != nil {
    return nil, fmt.Errorf("parsing bd ready output: %w", err)
}
```

## Fix
Extract into shared helper `parseBeadOutput()` or refactor to accept args.

